g）。\n客观精准： 就像你在给一个看不见的人讲故事，描述要极度客观且画面感强。\n\n文生图提示词示例：\n\n\"A cinematic, hyper-realistic medium shot captured on a 35mm lens, featuring a young woman with iridescent cybernetic implants standing in a rainy, neon-lit alleyway at night. She wears a translucent plastic raincoat over a tactical vest, with raindrops visibly clinging to the synthetic material. Her hair is short, silver, and wet, reflecting the pink and blue neon signs from the blurred shops in the background. The lighting is dramatic and volumetric, with a soft key light illuminating her face while the background dissolves into a bokeh of vibrant city lights, creating a moody, futuristic atmosphere typical of high-end cyberpunk photography.\"\n\n提供的主题为：某某\n请直接输出最终的英文 Prompt 段落。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 32, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [428.127685546875, 397.8822021484375], "pos": [1766.958251953125, 716.7781982421875], "widgets_values": ["A beautifully composed cinematic portrait rendered in ultra-high detail using Unreal Engine 5’s ray-traced lighting system, capturing an elegant East Asian female figure poised gracefully within a softly lit traditional Chinese chamber adorned with ink-washed scroll paintings framed by dark wood paneling; she stands centered under warm golden ambient light that filters through unseen windows, casting gentle shadows across her porcelain skin as if sculpted by late afternoon sunbeams — her long black hair flows loosely around her shoulders, delicately pinned back with ornate floral temple pins, cascading strands catching glimmers like liquid silk against the dim backdrop; draped in an ethereal ensemble blending ancient silks with modern fantasy design: a sheer tulle robe embroidered with shimmering gold threads floats open along her arms, revealing beneath it a lace-embellished corset top stitched with pastel blues and pinks, embellished with dangling gemstone chains and pearl beads that catch every subtle shift in illumination; waist cinched tightly by layered gauze sashes tied asymmetrically with crimson ribbons fluttering slightly mid-air, hinting at quiet movement or breeze lingering near her feet; both hands are raised gently toward her collarbones as though framing herself for contemplation, fingers lightly curled inward, eyes fixed directly ahead yet softened by melancholy thoughtfulness rather than direct gaze — shallow depth of field blurs the wooden furniture behind her subtly into dreamlike haze, emphasizing focus only upon her form and attire, while fine dust motes drift lazily suspended in air illuminated by diffused backlight, adding texture and magic realism without overpowering the serene stillness; overall mood evokes timeless elegance interwoven with mystical grace, reminiscent of classical poetry painted onto velvet curtains — this image feels alive not just visually but emotionally, inviting viewers to linger inside its hushed reverence, akin to stepping into a forgotten palace where beauty speaks silently through fabric, gesture, and shadow."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 22, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [29], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [278.486328125, 88], "pos": [528.4527587890625, 908.9425659179688], "widgets_values": ["一个亚洲美女，"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 27, "type": "JjkText", "propertie